00:11:23.978 --> 00:11:27.519
slowly re-acclimate
your body to positivity,

00:11:27.519 --> 00:11:29.317
build up friends, build up abundance

00:11:29.317 --> 00:11:31.023
build an amazing situation for yourself,

00:11:31.023 --> 00:11:32.372
and do amazing, amazing things.

00:11:32.372 --> 00:11:35.719
- There's a lot of
people who get frustrated

00:11:35.719 --> 00:11:39.496
who then say, "Enough is enough,
I'm going to do something."

00:11:39.496 --> 00:11:40.561
And then the next day they wake up and

00:11:40.561 --> 00:11:42.709
they're back to their old life.

00:11:42.709 --> 00:11:45.700
They had this moment of
boldness, a moment of greatness

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:48.267
and they fall back into
repeated patterns and habits

00:11:48.267 --> 00:11:50.999
and life just gets them down again

00:11:50.999 --> 00:11:52.998
and they go back to their
job and their regular life.

00:11:52.998 --> 00:11:55.403
How did you break that cycle?

00:11:55.403 --> 00:11:56.606
this is actually the day I'm going to go

00:11:56.606 --> 00:11:59.125
and do something bigger?

00:11:59.125 --> 00:12:01.791
- I think it was just a
moment of enough is a enough.

00:12:01.791 --> 00:12:04.230
I was sleeping on my sisters
couch for a couple of years

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:06.897
originally, and she had told me,

00:12:08.366 --> 00:12:09.658
"Are you going to start paying rent?"

00:12:09.658 --> 00:12:10.999
At about the year and a half mark.

00:12:10.999 --> 00:12:11.966
(laughing)

00:12:11.966 --> 00:12:13.413
Like, "when are you going
to start paying rent?"

00:12:13.413 --> 00:12:14.866
Because I was just
eating her food for free

00:12:14.866 --> 00:12:17.484
I was a slob, I didn't clean up

00:12:17.484 --> 00:12:20.703
I was just taking
advantage of the situation.

00:12:20.703 --> 00:12:21.938
And I was 24 years old or something

00:12:21.938 --> 00:12:25.173
and I just remember being like,
"It's time for me to grow up

00:12:25.173 --> 00:12:26.847
"and do something with my life."

00:12:26.847 --> 00:12:28.611
I've sat here for a year and a half,

00:12:28.611 --> 00:12:31.943
almost two years now,
depressed, miserable,

00:12:31.943 --> 00:12:35.421
whatever I was doing, making excuses.

00:12:35.421 --> 00:12:36.469
This isn't who I want to be.

00:12:36.469 --> 00:12:39.222
I aspire to be something greater.

00:12:39.222 --> 00:12:43.258
My parents didn't raise me to be this way.

00:12:43.258 --> 00:12:44.910
I wanted to make myself proud.

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:46.454
I wanted to make my last name proud.

00:12:46.454 --> 00:12:49.189
I wanted to make my family proud

00:12:49.189 --> 00:12:51.103
and I wanted to be a symbol.

00:12:51.103 --> 00:12:54.911
I think, you know, I've
always wanted to be a symbol

00:12:54.911 --> 00:12:57.921
of inspiration, of possibilities.

00:12:57.921 --> 00:13:02.635
From my sports days, I remember
the feeling after the games

00:13:02.635 --> 00:13:06.718
when parents or fans, or
parents of other players

00:13:07.877 --> 00:13:10.344
from other teams would
come up to me and say,

00:13:10.344 --> 00:13:13.070
"Thank you for showing me what's possible.

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:15.654
"There was no way you were able

00:13:15.654 --> 00:13:17.970
"to catch that ball, but
somehow you did that.

00:13:17.970 --> 00:13:19.539
"It blew my mind.

00:13:19.539 --> 00:13:20.896
"There was no way you
guys should have come back

00:13:20.896 --> 00:13:22.717
"after how much you were down,

00:13:22.717 --> 00:13:24.871
"and what you did blew me away."

00:13:24.871 --> 00:13:28.608
I loved hearing that, and
seeing in other people

00:13:28.608 --> 00:13:32.352
this spark of passion, this
excitement of possibility

00:13:32.352 --> 00:13:35.409
for what they could create in their life.

00:13:35.409 --> 00:13:39.576
And I wanted to be that
symbol of passion and vision,

00:13:40.433 --> 00:13:43.917
and focus and commitment, towards my dream

00:13:43.917 --> 00:13:45.838
to show other what's possible.

00:13:45.838 --> 00:13:48.414
And I've never been the
best at anything I've done.

00:13:48.414 --> 00:13:51.865
In sports, I was always the underdog,

00:13:51.865 --> 00:13:56.319
I was never the biggest,
fastest, or strongest dog.

00:13:56.319 --> 00:13:59.220
And I think I just wanted to
show people what's possible,

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:00.715
so that's what I'm still doing.

00:14:00.715 --> 00:14:04.973
I'm just a kid from a small
town in Delaware, Ohio

00:14:04.973 --> 00:14:09.687
who had a lot of emotional
turmoil inside growing up

00:14:09.687 --> 00:14:13.544
and I'm trying to show
people what's possible

00:14:13.544 --> 00:14:15.055
no matter where you come from.

00:14:15.055 --> 00:14:16.143
- Thank you guys so much for watching,

00:14:16.143 --> 00:14:17.282
I hope you enjoyed.

00:14:17.282 --> 00:14:19.550
I'd love to know what did
you take from this video

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:21.915
that you're going to
immediately apply somehow

00:14:21.915 --> 00:14:23.442
to your life or to your business.

00:14:23.442 --> 00:14:24.922
Leave it down in the comments below.

00:14:24.922 --> 00:14:27.555
I'm really excited to
see what you have to say.

00:14:27.555 --> 00:14:28.673
So, thank you guys again for watching.

00:14:28.673 --> 00:14:31.056
I believe in you, I hope
you continue to believe

00:14:31.056 --> 00:14:34.608
in yourself, and whatever
your one word is,

00:14:34.608 --> 00:14:37.108
much love, I'll see you soon.

